msgid "Savegames are stored next to the Ambermoon.net.exe inside the sub-folder 'Saves'."
msgstr "Zapisane gry są przechowywane obok pliku Ambermoon.net.exe w podfolderze \"Saves\"."

#. Remake text (Version selector texts). Translate only the text; keep {0} placeholders and ^ line breaks.
#: Remake/Version selector texts/003
